{"articleNo":"666","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=666&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"▦2009-1학기 대학원 수료자등록 추가신청 안내▦","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.02.23","hit":"17328","attachments":[{"name":"수료자등록신청서(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=666&attachNo=69294"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"367\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"41\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2009-1학기 대학원 수료자등록 추가신청 안내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2009학년도 1학기 수료자 등록 신청기간((2009. 2. 4 ~ 2. 6)을&nbsp;기 안내하였으나&nbsp;해당기간에 신청하지&nbsp;못한 학생들의 문의가 많아 부득이&nbsp;추가 신청기간을 공지하오니&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#ff1493\">2009년 8월</font> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#ff1493\">학위를 받기위한 학위청구나 논문연구를 계속할 학생은</font> &nbsp;해당기간에 반드시 수료자 등록을 신청하시기 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">1. 수료자등록 대상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 일반대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원 수료생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 본교 대학원 수료생은 누구나 신청 가능(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">수료후 논문제출시한 규정 폐지)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2. 수료자 등록구분 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">일 반&nbsp; 등 록 :&nbsp; 논문연구를 계속하고자 하는 자</font> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">논문연구등록 :&nbsp; 논문연구학점 미 취득자(논문연구 불합격자)</font> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">3. 수료자등록신청 및 접수</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수료자 등록신청기간 : </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#ff1493\">2009. 2. 26(목) [1일간] </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수료자 등록신청장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">각 학과 종합학사행정실 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 제출서류 : 수료자등록신청서 1부, 수료증명서 1부</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">4. 수료자 등록생 등록금 납부 금액 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">일반등록 : 등록금액의 5% </font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#ff1493\">논문연구등록: 등록금액의 10%</font> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 납부기간 : <font color=\"#c71585\">2009. 3. 5(목) ~ 3. 6(금) [2일간]</font> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 고지서 출력 : 원스톱서비스/로그인/등록/등록금고지서조회및출력&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 등록금 납부장소 : 농협 전국 각 지점 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 등록금 납부금액 : 수료자별 해당되는 등록금액 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"111\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\" height=\"39\">\n            <p cl